---
import Motifs from './Motifs.astro';
---

<section class='about' id='about' aria-labelledby='about-title'>
  <Motifs name='seed' class='about-seed' />
  <div class='about-inner'>
    <header class='section-heading'>
      <p>01 / ABOUT</p>
      <h2 id='about-title'>所谓“土壤”，<br />究竟意味着什么？</h2>
    </header>

    <div class='about-body'>
      <blockquote>
        <p>“或许，绝望恰是孕育人类希望的土壤；<br />未经荒诞，难觅生命真义。”</p>
        <footer>—— 瓦茨拉夫·哈维尔</footer>
      </blockquote>

      <div class='about-copy'>
        <p class='lead'>
          这不是一部剧情梗概，也不是逐项罗列象征的观剧手册。它从作品的形式、语言与思想传统出发，追问愿望与诅咒为何拥有同一根源。
        </p>
        <p>
          Jen A. Blue 以炼金术意义上的“腐化”为枢纽，把灵魂宝石、悲叹之种、魔女与圆环之理置于同一转化过程之中；散落于画面、台词、叙事结构与跨文本引用中的线索，由此汇成一条可以追问、也可以反驳的批评路径。
        </p>
        <ul aria-label='本书采用的批评视角'>
          <li>炼金术与腐化</li>
          <li>后现代批评</li>
          <li>佛教思想</li>
          <li>女性主义</li>
          <li>《浮士德》</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: var(--book-pale, #fff4f8);
    background: var(--book-black, #18151c);
  }

  .about::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    z-index: -1;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 12% 16%, rgb(232 77 138 / 0.15), transparent 28%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 88% 78%, rgb(111 74 168 / 0.18), transparent 30%);
  }

  .about-inner {
    width: min(100% - 2rem, 76rem);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: clamp(6rem, 11vw, 10.5rem);
  }

  .section-heading {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(10rem, 0.5fr) minmax(0, 1.5fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    align-items: start;
    padding-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(255 244 248 / 0.18);
  }

  .section-heading p {
    margin: 0.7rem 0 0;
    color: var(--madoka-pink, #e84d8a);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display, var(--font-serif, serif));
    font-size: clamp(2.65rem, 6vw, 5.4rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    line-height: 1.16;
  }

  .about-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(17rem, 0.82fr) minmax(0, 1.18fr);
    gap: clamp(3.5rem, 9vw, 9rem);
    padding-top: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.75rem);
  }

  blockquote {
    margin: 0;
    align-self: start;
  }

  blockquote::before {
    content: '“';
    display: block;
    height: 2.6rem;
    color: var(--madoka-pink, #e84d8a);
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 5rem;
    line-height: 1;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  blockquote p {
    margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display, var(--font-serif, serif));
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.2vw, 2.45rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  blockquote footer {
    color: rgb(255 244 248 / 0.58);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .about-copy {
    max-width: 39rem;
  }

  .about-copy p {
    margin: 0;
    color: rgb(255 244 248 / 0.7);
    font-family: var(--font-serif, serif);
    font-size: clamp(0.98rem, 1.55vw, 1.08rem);
    line-height: 2;
    text-align: justify;
  }

  .about-copy .lead {
    color: var(--book-pale, #fff4f8);
    font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 1.85vw, 1.28rem);
  }

  .about-copy p + p {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  li {
    padding: 0.55rem 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 244 248 / 0.24);
    color: rgb(255 244 248 / 0.78);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  li:nth-child(3n + 1) {
    border-color: rgb(232 77 138 / 0.5);
  }

  li:nth-child(3n + 2) {
    border-color: rgb(111 74 168 / 0.65);
  }

  :global(.about-seed) {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: -1;
    right: -2.5rem;
    bottom: -5rem;
    width: clamp(16rem, 32vw, 30rem);
    color: var(--homura-violet, #6f4aa8);
    opacity: 0.1;
    transform: rotate(12deg);
  }

  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .section-heading,
    .about-body {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .section-heading,
    .about-body {
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .about-copy p {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 35rem) {
    .about-inner {
      width: min(100% - 1.25rem, 76rem);
    }
  }
</style>
